OL,3,GNEWSA'Dad was different when he
OL,4,Areturned from Aberfan'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Dad was part of a mobilisation unit,
OL,7,Fwhich worked with the civil defence and
OL,8,Fthey were training when they were
OL,9,Fcalled to Aberfan," she recalled.
